Z||000002||88CoupeV6||09-24-2001||10:51 AM||||I will post some show pics when I get them. They will be courtesy of Eric, Boomtastic on the forum. We had great weather and some sunburn too  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P> Thanks to all at FOCONE for a good time. <P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">   <BR><B>Also 88 Yellow GT</B> :D  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||1
Z||000003||Old Lar||09-24-2001||08:49 PM||||I'll stick some photos that I took at the show on Rutland.<P>PACE CAR<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/PaceCar.jpg"> <P><BR>Fran's PACE CAR <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fran's_1.jpg"> <P>Andrew & Lias Virzi 87 Blue Coupe<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87Blue.jpg"> <P>The 87 class seem to have a common color scheme.  Chis Mitchells 87 has the rare add on after market option of POWER STEERING. <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87s.jpg"> <P>A Kelly Family car with Graphics.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Kelly.jpg"> <P><BR>Mrs. Phil Randolph's (Gwen) T-top 4cylinder (131000 mile) coupe.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Randolph'sTtop.jpg"> <P>I have to especially thank Bill Dorosz for leading Me, Fran and AC from Kick Hill Farms  back to civilization over some nice twisty roads.  Its hard to lose the Artero as a pace car.  (I had gotten Fran, AC and me lost trying to get to Rutland. Mass should spend a few bucks on road signs)  Then going to Kick Hill in a carvan was easy.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Artero.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Old Lar||09-24-2001||09:00 PM||||<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88s_1.jpg"> <P>Kick Hill Farms is a rathe laid back place.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/KickHillCat.jpg"> <P>However there are parts of more than 700 Fieros present. Fenders..pick your color front passenger side.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/KickHillFenders.jpg"> <P>Kick Hill Stalactites (headlight covers hanging from the ceiling)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/KickHillStalactites.jpg"> <P>Guage pods??<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/KickHillGuages.jpg"> <P><BR>My favorite The Emus of Kick Hill.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/KichHillEmu.jpg"> <P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000005||Fiero5||09-24-2001||09:54 PM||||More pics please  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <P>Steve<P>------------------<BR>                                <IMG SRC="http://a1040.g.akamai.net/f/1040/759/1h/206.29.192.139/info/pics/sept11.jpg">                             <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||1
