Z||000009||MsBeth||09-25-2001||04:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 88CoupeV6:<BR><B>I wish I could have made it to kick-hill, But having to get up at 12:30 AM Monday for work made it impossible.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> As it was I only got 5 hours.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Oh so that's what happened to you and Jaime ... I was wondering when we got to Bobs where you two had gotten to.   We sure did miss you guys.  Preload suxs huh?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blue_2.gif">  <P>MsBeth||||reg||1
